  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.5.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.4.1...v10.5.0) (2026-05-12)\n\n### Features\n\n* **cli:** support new slnx solution format ([#1105](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1105)) ([86ba0db](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/86ba0dbfc32bdb6863def54b3bb1787b0312b33c)), closes [#1104](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1104)\n* **CRDS:** add ScaleSubresourceAttribute for enabling HPA scaling ([#1095](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1095)) ([ae86735](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/ae867358bfd1d3f1be1690eab560ede84e93c8e8)), closes [#924](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/924)\n* **crds:** add support for marking `spec` as required via `[Required]` attribute at class level or by auto-infer from direct nested required properties ([#1097](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1097)) ([47964b8](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/47964b83f7779e18e6611e52cebc1e265319ec55)), closes [#885](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/885)\n* **crds:** introduce retry with backoff pattern to crd-installer ([#1103](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1103)) ([7384a3b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/7384a3bf671b82dbbe754db4383b5a44d07016ab))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **crd:** added guid support ([#1113](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1113)) ([e0743cc](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e0743cc0b60d7d251f3b03fc3b08ee9c90442197))\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **docs:** update react monorepo to v19.2.6 ([#1106](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1106)) ([e2971b5](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e2971b51d076688028a8ffdd6d98169802c86888))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.10 ([#1107](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1107)) ([1504c4c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/1504c4c67bd5201b4ba2b8e9fd1cf43134721661))\n'",
